---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout lang="en" title="Contact" description="How to reach HSL's Blog with error reports, correction requests, partnership or other questions.">
  <header class="page-top"><div class="article-shell"><div class="section-kicker">Contact</div><h1>Contact</h1><p>Error reports, correction requests and partnership questions go to email.</p></div></header>
  <div class="article-body article-shell">
    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p><a href="mailto:coolwin200@gmail.com">coolwin200@gmail.com</a></p>
    <h2>Errors and corrections</h2>
    <p>If something is wrong, send the article URL and the source that shows it. Confirmed errors are fixed and the updated date advances. A comment under the article works too.</p>
    <h2>Partnerships and advertising</h2>
    <p>Partnerships or sponsorships do not change editorial judgments, and any commercial relationship is labeled clearly in the article concerned.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
